      "writtenOn": "2022-02-02T21:02:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t need to check fHasJoinControlPoint here, since it could be the first update. I added this assert mostly for safety, since we shouldn\u0027t be writing control points that aren\u0027t finite anyways, but finiteness isn\u0027t being used for state anymore.",
